(61,20,'28',0,'TUTORIAL MONDAY: CARA BIKIN KONTEN VIRAL!','								<p>[Slide 1]\r\n</p><p>Hook Formula yang Bikin Views Kamu Meningkat!</p><p>\r\n\r\n[Slide 2]</p><p><span data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600;\">Teknik viral 1:</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"> Power Words - Gunakan kata \"Rahasia\", \"Terbukti\", \"Eksklusif\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"3\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Teknik viral 2:</span> Curiosity Gap - Buat judul yang bikin penasaran tapi gak kasih jawaban\r\n</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"5\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Teknik viral 3:</span> Social Proof Numbers - Tambahkan angka spesifik \"127% lebih efektif\"\r\n</p><p>\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"7\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">[Slide 3]\r\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"7\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Secret 1:</span> AIDA Formula - Attention → Interest → Desire → Action dalam setiap caption\r\n</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"9\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Secret 2:</span> Emotional Trigger Words - \"Bayangkan\", \"Rasakan\", \"Buktikan sendiri\"</p><p>\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"11\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Secret 3:</span> Call-to-Action Placement - Taruh CTA di awal, tengah, dan akhir caption</p><p>\r\n\r\n[Silde 4]\r\nButuh bantuan eksekusi? DM kita aja! <!-- notionvc: baf7bb60-6abc-4a63-b6c8-57c353d2ce60 -->							</p>						',5,'2025-08-02','2025-08-02','2025-08-27 15:18:20',NULL,'Promo','Instagram','https://pin.it/4UqpoOc4D',NULL),
