(293,22,'20',NULL,'Feeds-Gigi bolong: tambal atau cabut? (carousel)','                                                                SLIDE 1 <br>Still unsure whether to <strong data-start=\"122\" data-end=\"141\">fill or extract</strong> your tooth?<br data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"156\">\r\nCheck the signs on the next slide ➜<br><br>SLIDE 2<br><p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"83\"><strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"81\">Still can be filled if:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"191\">\r\n<li data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"114\">\r\n<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"114\">The cavity isn’t too large</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"160\">\r\n<p data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"160\">The tooth root is still in good condition</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"191\">\r\n<p data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"191\">The enamel is still intact<br>swipe </p><p data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"191\"><br>SLIDE 3</p><p data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"191\"><strong data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"69\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Time to choose extraction if:</strong></p><p data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"191\">\r\n</p><ul data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"142\">\r\n<li data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"110\">\r\n<p data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"110\">The tooth crown is already damaged</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"142\">\r\n<p data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"142\">Only the tooth root remains<br><br>What you need to know before the treatment</p><p data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"142\">swipe</p></li></ul></li></ul>                                                ',5,'2025-11-17','2025-12-02','2025-11-02 11:47:25',23,'','Instagram','Referensi : https://www.instagram.com/p/DPf4j_WE4Ug/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==',NULL),
