(748,22,'42,49',NULL,'FEEDS- Ke klinik gigi pas puasa, batal ga ya?','                &lt;p&gt;Slide 1:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Perawatan gigi saat puasa, batal nggak ya?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yuk pahami faktanya!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Slide 2:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Menurut Fatwa MUI&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 1rem; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;&quot;&gt;250/e/mui-kb/v/2018&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;Perawatan gigi saat puasa diperbolehkan selama dilakukan dengan hati-hati dan tidak berlebihan. Jika air tertelan tanpa sengaja, maka tidak membatalkan puasa.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-width: normal; font-size: 18.2px; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 18.19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-width: normal; font-size: 18.2px; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 18.19px;&quot;&gt;Di Rio Dental Care, kami pastikan perawatan nyaman dan tetap aman saat puasa.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-width: normal; font-size: 18.2px; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 18.19px;&quot;&gt;Yuk, Rawat Senyum sehatmu selama Ramadhan!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;            ',5,'2026-02-20','2026-02-21','2026-02-20 11:02:04',42,'','','',NULL),
