e=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;zYmgkd#vvzi1e&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_1x&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;Patuhi Regulasi Legal:&lt;/span&gt; Lengkapi perizinan usaha dan daftarkan hak kekayaan intelektual (merk/logo) perusahaan Anda ke instansi terkait agar terhindar dari risiko hukum.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;oSLmPe#HokZ0d&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_13&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgBCAwQAQ&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;fly6D#d5Qebf&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_1n&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;zYmgkd#vvzi1e&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_1o&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;Buat Perencanaan yang Jelas:&lt;/span&gt; Susun rencana operasional, pemasaran, dan manajemen yang berorientasi pada eksekusi produk yang cepat mendapatkan umpan balik.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;!--TgQPHd||[]--&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;oSLmPe#HokZ0d&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_1d&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgBCAwQBw&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;fly6D#d5Qebf&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_1e&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;zYmgkd#vvzi1e&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_1f&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;Lakukan Riset Pasar:&lt;!--TgQPHd||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Lakukan riset berkala (minimal 5-6 pertanyaan terstruktur) kepada target pelanggan untuk memastikan produk Anda relevan dengan kebutuhan pasar.&lt;!--TgQPHd||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What Not To Do&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;oSLmPe#HokZ0d&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_32&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgBCBkQAQ&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;fly6D#d5Qebf&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_33&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;zYmgkd#vvzi1e&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_34&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;Mencampur Aset:&lt;!--TgQPHd||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Jangan menggunakan uang perusahaan untuk kebutuhan atau gaya hidup pribadi.&lt;!--TgQPHd||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;!--TgQPHd||[]--&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;oSLmPe#HokZ0d&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_3b&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgBCBkQBw&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;fly6D#d5Qebf&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_3c&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;zYmgkd#vvzi1e&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_3d&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;Mengabaikan Manajemen Kas:&lt;!--TgQPHd||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Jangan terlena dengan tingginya omzet jika tidak diiringi dengan penagihan piutang yang ketat.&lt;!--TgQPHd||[]--&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;oSLmPe#HokZ0d&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;DkFyGe_3b&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgBCBkQBw&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tidak Mengurusi Legalitas : &lt;/b&gt;Membiarkan perusahaan berjalan tanpa mengurusi legalitas bisa membuat perusahaan kamu terkena pidana.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;p&gt;                        &lt;/p&gt;                                                                        ',5,'2026-06-25','2026-08-11','2026-06-09 14:24:07',47,'Promo','Instagram','https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1rYpQkJ1v_6o3GZOBJ4yRMw8p2nGONaWsdjM13znX3FU/edit?usp=sharing','2026-08-07 11:33:38'),
