(1113,59,'49',NULL,'Pembuatan SLO','                                                                                &lt;div class=&quot;otQkpb&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;a7qCn#ZxCkTb&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_j&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;S.1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Title :Langkah-langkah Pembuatan SLO&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;KdQfFc#d5Qebf&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_m&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;zYmgkd#vvzi1e&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_n&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;S.2&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 1rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Title : Pastikan Instalasi Aman&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 1rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sub :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Pastikan instalasi listrik Anda dikerjakan oleh instalatur atau Badan Usaha yang terdaftar untuk mendapatkan NIDI (Nomor Identitas Instalasi Tenaga Listrik).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 1rem;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;KdQfFc#d5Qebf&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_v&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 1rem; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;zYmgkd#vvzi1e&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_w&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Title : Pilih Lembaga Pemeriksa (LIT)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sub :&lt;/b&gt; Anda dapat mengajukan permohonan penerbitan NIDI dan SLO sekaligus melalui aplikasi resmi seperti &lt;span jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_x&quot; class=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;mouseenter:&amp;amp;GBCAff_x|WOQqYb;mouseleave:&amp;amp;GBCAff_x|Tx5Rb;focusin:&amp;amp;GBCAff_x|mrwrPd;focusout:&amp;amp;GBCAff_x|mFndSc;pointerdown:&amp;amp;GBCAff_x|FEiYhc;click:&amp;amp;GBCAff_x|C6aVhd;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;KMhGd#Mx1qPe&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;H23r4e&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwiSjtqa0eWVAxXoSWwGHTwvM88Qy_kOegoIAggACAAIAhAQ&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACAIQEA&quot; href=&quot;https://listrik1.id/artikel/17/Ini-Cara-Urus-NIDI-dan-SLO-Tanpa-Ribet&quot; ping=&quot;/url?sa=t&amp;amp;source=web&amp;amp;rct=j&amp;amp;url=https://listrik1.id/artikel/17/Ini-Cara-Urus-NIDI-dan-SLO-Tanpa-Ribet&amp;amp;ved=2ahUKEwiSjtqa0eWVAxXoSWwGHTwvM88Qy_kOegoIAggACAAIAhAQ&amp;amp;opi=89978449&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(153, 195, 255); border-bottom: 0px rgb(153, 195, 255);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(153, 195, 255); border-bottom: 0px rgb(153, 195, 255);&quot;&gt;ListrikOne&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; atau marketplace rekanan Kementerian ESDM, seperti Listrik Nusantara.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 1rem;&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;KdQfFc#d5Qebf&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_15&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 1rem; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;zYmgkd#vvzi1e&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_16&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;S.3&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Title : Isi Data Permohonan&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sub :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Siapkan data KTP, alamat lengkap, dan koordinat lokasi. Masukkan NIDI yang sudah Anda miliki.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;KdQfFc#d5Qebf&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_7u&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 1rem; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;zYmgkd#vvzi1e&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_7v&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Title :&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Pembayaran Biaya Inspeksi&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sub :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Lakukan pembayaran biaya pemeriksaan sesuai dengan kapasitas daya listrik yang diajukan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 1rem;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;otQkpb&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;a7qCn#ZxCkTb&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_j&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 1rem;&quot;&gt;S.4&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;KdQfFc#d5Qebf&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_84&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 1rem; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;zYmgkd#vvzi1e&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_85&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Title :Inspeksi Lapangan&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sub :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Petugas/Tenaga Teknik dari LIT akan datang ke lokasi untuk menguji kelayakan instalasi listrik Anda (tahanan isolasi, pembumian/grounding, dll).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 1rem;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;KdQfFc#d5Qebf&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_8e&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 1rem; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;zYmgkd#vvzi1e&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_8f&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;Title :&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Penerbitan SLO&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sub :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Jika instalasi dinyatakan &quot;Laik&quot;, SLO akan diterbitkan maksimal 3-5 hari kerja dan datanya akan terintegrasi langsung dengan sistem PLN untuk proses penyambungan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 1rem;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;otQkpb&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;a7qCn#ZxCkTb&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_j&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot;&gt;S.5&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;otQkpb&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;a7qCn#ZxCkTb&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_j&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot;&gt;Title : Pembayaran Pelunasan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;otQkpb&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;a7qCn#ZxCkTb&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_j&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot;&gt;Setelah Uji Riksa SLO, lakukan pembayaran pelunasan yang sesuai dengan kesepakatan biaya yang sudah ditentukan sebelumnya&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;otQkpb&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;a7qCn#ZxCkTb&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_j&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot;&gt;Title : Serah terima sertifikat SLO&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;otQkpb&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; jsaction=&quot;&quot; jscontroller=&quot;a7qCn#ZxCkTb&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; jsuid=&quot;GBCAff_j&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);&quot;&gt;Setelah pembayaran pelunasan selesai, dan sertifikat SLO sudah terbit, sertifikat akan diserahkan kepada klien, yang artinya instalasi listrik sudah dianggap aman dan legal oleh ESDM&lt;/div&gt;                                                                                                                    ',5,'2026-07-15','2026-08-05','2026-07-15 15:28:11',55,'Edukasi','Instagram','https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/13-3M1MdLsKlciMyO43305xJXL6vYgbs2nSDV9e566Ws/edit?usp=sharing','2026-08-12 10:05:59'),
